  if(control.closest('#sheetDruidWildCompanion')){const help={'data-wc-form':'Choose a 2024 CR 0 Beast. Flying and swimming forms are allowed here even before Wild Shape permits them. Wild Companion makes the spirit Fey.','data-wc-payment':'Choose exactly one payment: a Wild Shape use, an ordinary spell slot, an available Pact Magic slot or a created slot. Casting here does not use coins or add a prepared spell.','data-wc-confirm':'You can have only one familiar. Confirm a new casting changes your active familiar; existing manual cards stay as reference records.','data-wc-hp':'Current HP belongs only to this familiar. At zero it disappears and needs another paid casting to return.','data-wc-temp':'The familiar’s temporary HP. Damage uses these before its current HP. They do not affect your character’s temporary HP.','data-wc-max':'Adjust maximum familiar HP for an effect resolved at the table. Raising the maximum does not heal; record any healing separately. Zero ends the familiar. A new summoning resets its base statistics.','data-wc-amount':'Enter damage or healing for this familiar, then choose the matching action. Overflow damage never passes to your character.'};for(const [attr,text]of Object.entries(help))if(control.hasAttribute(attr))return text;}
  if(control.closest('#sheetDruidWildShape')){const texts={'data-wild-search':'Searches only forms eligible for your actual Druid level and rules edition.','data-wild-form':'Choose your own form. Legacy forms require having seen the animal; revised forms must be among your known forms.','data-wild-seen':'Confirm that your character has seen this animal. The app remembers recently used seen forms; your DM decides what your character has seen.','data-wild-gear':'Merged or dropped equipment grants no worn item effects here. Wear current loadout applies its supported effects; ask your DM whether this form can wear it.','data-wild-temp-choice':'Temporary HP never adds together. Choose the new grant, your existing temporary HP or whichever is higher.','data-wild-known-slot':'Select a revised Druid known form. Choices follow your Druid level. After a Long Rest you may replace one; changing this field does not spend a use.','data-wild-hp':'Legacy: changes only the form’s HP; zero reverts without altering normal HP. Revised: changes your character’s current HP.','data-wild-temp':'Shared temporary HP, consumed before form or character HP. These do not stack.','data-wild-amount':'Enter damage or healing, then use the matching button. Legacy excess damage passes to normal HP when the form reaches zero.'};for(const [attr,text]of Object.entries(texts))if(control.hasAttribute(attr))return text;}
